  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-09-09T00:35:15.572246Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-20T01:59:11.282228Z",
  "totalBlocks": 32,
  "translatedBlocks": 29,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6d2b5282d4655c6d",
      "translationZh": "OpenCode Senses 可以检查截图、精确提取 OCR 文本、检测并定位对象、放大局部区域、比较两张图像、测量颜色、裁剪图像并添加标注，甚至还能对图像进行反向搜索。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b90ac6864cf15941",
      "translationZh": "所有功能都在本地运行，因此既保护隐私，又免费，而且不需要 API 密钥。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d6460808bda3578a",
      "translationZh": "我以前经常使用许多开源编程模型，比如 DeepSeek V4 Flash，它们尚不支持视觉能力（直到现在）。但我主要担心的是，即使这些新推出的开源模型内置了视觉支持，其视觉能力也可能不如专门的视觉层强大。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "14f2248688366429",
      "translationZh": "我原本计划在一个月前就把它完整地做出来，但当时还有一些工作要完成。这个插件专门针对 UI 设计、调试等工作流程而设计；纯文本模型在这些场景中往往难以胜任，因为它们根本看不到正在发生什么。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "edc1ae9ac1ed987d",
      "translationZh": "视觉插件与 OpenCode 之间的通信层被刻意设计得非常精简，因此使用起来仍然感觉是在与一个多模态智能体协作，而不是使用一个独立的视觉工具。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b02e4d04cc85bc20",
      "translationZh": "先别急着把它当作又一个视觉插件，它的设计相当不同。它是一个 Python + TypeScript 混合插件，因为它集成了 Photon Inference Engine，用于本地视觉推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b69061139a517ce7",
      "translationZh": "目前主要有这 13 个工具：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d368dd3ec7d1cbcd",
      "translationZh": "inspect — 理解图像：场景、布局、元素、图像描述和 OCR。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c2302ef812c89550",
      "translationZh": "ocr — 提取精确文本，包括代码和错误消息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d0a183ed52c20536",
      "translationZh": "detect — 查找对象或 UI 元素，并给出边界框。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3b415fd4f0c71883",
      "translationZh": "point — 定位对象或元素的中心点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8e7d6fc26fe156c6",
      "translationZh": "segment — 从图像中分离出一个对象。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b54ccba19a5f681",
      "translationZh": "crop — 使用归一化坐标裁剪特定区域。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d8e85013f04a1be",
      "translationZh": "zoom — 放大某个区域，并重新分析细小的细节或文本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dddcd4cd3b4d794b",
      "translationZh": "colors — 获取确定性的颜色、调色板、亮度和 RGB 数据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d87802a0678c5899",
      "translationZh": "diff — 比较两张图像并找出发生变化的区域。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a5608e5d612e9cf3",
      "translationZh": "annotate — 将检测到的框和点绘制到图像上。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9c232e001994165d",
      "translationZh": "metadata — 查看图像格式、尺寸、大小、DPI 和 EXIF。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "67a62d8dd322aab0",
      "translationZh": "reverse — 在本地或通过 Yandex 进行图像反向搜索。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf5a1d84cdeb9ebd",
      "translationZh": "status — 检查模型、设备、VRAM、推理时间和运行时状态。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "509558b7717bed46",
      "translationZh": "作为对比，我在自己的 RTX 3050 上使用这个插件，完全在本地运行，响应时间约为 300 ms（现在工具调用只需 84 ms，因此速度大幅提升了 3.6x，具体取决于主模型的 tokens/sec；我测到的最低时间是 38ms）。相比前沿模型，这速度快得惊人。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fc09340a71ad0aee",
      "translationZh": "此外，还有一个由 Yandex 提供支持的可选图像反向搜索功能（现在也新增了 SauceNAO 和 TraceMoe 作为服务提供方），不需要 API key。如果你想借助互联网上的上下文来搜索图像，就可以使用它。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "470f0941775aa34b",
      "translationZh": "OpenCode 中的 Exa 等内置网页搜索服务也能与 OpenCode Senses 很好地配合。它甚至可以直接查看发布在互联网上的图像，不过会使用一个小型本地缓存来存储这些图像。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b76faa999e3ccba6",
      "translationZh": "我目前还只开发到一半，所以非常欢迎大家提供反馈、想法和批评。如果你有任何想法，欢迎在下方留言，我会认真研究。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a11f52fc2365728f",
      "translationZh": "注：我之前在 r/opencodeCLI 上发布过这个插件（大家都很喜欢用它！！），有人问我能不能提供 AMD 硬件支持，还有个人想在他的 9070XT 上运行它。不幸的是，我没有 AMD 硬件，只有一块 Nvidia GPU。不过，我已经为此提了一个 issue。这个插件的推理引擎大部分由 Photon (kestrel) 负责。如果你们希望为它添加 AMD 支持，也可以在这个 issue 中提出请求并留言。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "510f8c9c651d725b",
      "translationZh": "还有个人让我提供 Pi agent 支持，但我不知道该怎么做，因为我觉得 Pi agent 生态系统相当分散，或者说缺乏整合，欢迎大家贡献！！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1672b5c78ded5d2c",
      "translationZh": "如果你有任何建议，请在插件仓库中提一个 issue，或者直接在这里留言，说说你未来会需要哪些工具。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "af657ff092988481",
      "translationZh": "另外，如果你喜欢我做的东西，这里是我的 Buy Me A Coffee ☕",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "32ee0a1bc01c7dbf",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/RevolutionaryPen4661 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
